 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "02OLB04:323",
   "ptr": "0x323",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "「山にキノコを採りに行ってたおかげで、\\n",
   "en": "\"I'd gone up the mountain to pick mushrooms... and so I alone survived...",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB04:34e",
   "ptr": "0x34e",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "  私だけが生き残ってしまいました・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 02OLB04:323"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB04:37a",
   "ptr": "0x37a",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　この町は最初の波動の時、まったく\\n",
   "en": "This town took no damage at all in the first Wave, so I suppose everyone felt completely safe.",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB04:3a1",
   "ptr": "0x3a1",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "  被害を受けなかったので、みんな\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 02OLB04:37a"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB04:3c6",
   "ptr": "0x3c6",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "  安心しきっていたのでしょう。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 02OLB04:37a"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB04:3ea",
   "ptr": "0x3ea",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  そこに、あんな大きな波動が来るなん\\n",
   "en": "And then a Wave that huge came...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB04:413",
   "ptr": "0x413",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "  て・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 02OLB04:3ea"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB04:423",
   "ptr": "0x423",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　山から下りて町に駆けつけた時には、\\n",
   "en": "When I came down the mountain and rushed into town, there were bodies everywhere... It was like looking at hell.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB04:44c",
   "ptr": "0x44c",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "  もう、そこらじゅう死体だらけで・・・\\n",
